http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/10159922/a7f3579864067e657cca9261c98684ab23a8dfc8.png

- now you can equip Starbase on the Asteroid scene;
- chat is available on all scenes;
- optimized Angar scene;
- improved "Newbies Tutorial";
- supplemented and modified the Oort Cloud scene;
- hiding of the interface elements is realized in the battle;
- fixed the system messages duplication problem;
- refined game windows: shop, missions, advisers, market, messages, diplomacy, combat results, rating, galactic news;
- a new information window will appear in case of lost connection to the game;
- slowing work problem in the inventory is fixed (when the inventory is full);
- the League and the Rank at the player profile is added in the Rating;
- self-closing windows problem is fixed;
- added  the 13th ammunition slot for captains;
- the new Offers tab is added at the Advisors window;
- fixed the incorrect display problem with the building in the information panel (during upgrading / building);
- joining the ally problem is fixed (during attack the alien base) ;
- the opportunity to fight on Fortress-ship is added in training and duel modes;
- equipment templates are not longer include the Runes;
- fixed the wrong exchange rate of tritium for deuterium problem;
- added the possibility to open the lobby back after it was closed;
- fixed the gun/radar repair countdown, now the exact repair time is indicated;
- instant updating of resources, statuses, and missions function is modified;
- fixed sciences progress problem (studying not longer stop);
- now you can enter the game and send a chat message by pressing the Enter button;
- the whole Cloud optimization (kick from game problem)

